{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-whitesnake_yure",
  "id": "source-35902",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "35902001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "叫天下无情人吃我一剑——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35902002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哇呀，怎么招呼都不打一声就要打人！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35902003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "咦，这身打扮，这个装束，你该不会是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35902004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "我是「小青」，在找我姐姐「白素贞」，你们可曾见过她？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35902005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "竟然真的让我遇到了《白蛇传》中的两姐妹……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35902006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "好不真实……我不是在做梦吧……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35902007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "优纪，快告诉我我不是在做梦……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35902008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这还不简单，快用折扇用力敲一下自己的脑袋。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35902009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "嘶，果然好痛。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35902010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这下明白了吧，你不是在做梦哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35902011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "你们在嚷嚷什么，究竟见到我姐姐了没有？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35902012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "啊，抱歉，我太兴奋了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35902013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "我们没有见到过白娘子，你和她走散了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35902014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "真让人担心，会不会在哪里迷路了呀？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35902015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "这种事情，我绝不允许！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35902016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "让自己崇拜的对象陷入困顿和危险，真爱粉是万万不能接受的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35902017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "喔，玉夏一瞬间爆发出了惊人的力量。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35902018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "废话少说，我们现在就动身去找人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
